  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Whats on? Join in on the action!"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "* Some of our activities are restricted due to COVID19",
      "html": "* Some of our activities are restricted due to COVID19"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "Coral 2000 Spectacular panoramic view of the reef",
        "Dive with Sharks Heart - racing action with the predators of the Red Sea",
        "Sting-ray cave Snap a selfie with a sting-ray!",
        "Snorkelling Family friendly activity!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "Coral 2000",
        "Dive with Sharks",
        "Sting-ray cave",
        "Snorkelling"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "src": "https://coralworld.co.il/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/coral2000-small.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "width": 390,
      "height": 250
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "src": "https://coralworld.co.il/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/sharkdive-small.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "width": 390,
      "height": 250
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "src": "https://coralworld.co.il/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/firstdive-small.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "width": 390,
      "height": 250
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "src": "https://coralworld.co.il/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/snorkel-small.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "width": 390,
      "height": 250
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Coral 2000"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Take a memorable journey in the Red Sea.",
      "html": "<strong>Take a memorable journey in the Red Sea. </strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Visit the Japanese Gardens and Coral Reserve in submersible boat!",
      "html": "<strong>Visit the Japanese Gardens and Coral Reserve in submersible boat!</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Coral 2000 sets sail with a crew ready to view underwater windows and meet the locals!",
      "html": "Coral 2000 sets sail with a crew ready to view underwater windows and meet the locals!"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Be captivated on a great journey by rare fish, coral colonies and amazing sea creatures in their natural habitat.",
      "html": "Be captivated on a great journey by rare fish, coral colonies and amazing sea creatures in their natural habitat."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "* Booking in advance is required ( Please contact us by email, phone or Facebook)",
      "html": "* Booking in advance is required ( Please contact us by email, phone or Facebook)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Adults: 40 NIS",
      "html": "Adults: 40 NIS"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Children: 34 NIS",
      "html": "Children: 34 NIS"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "src": "https://coralworld.co.il/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/coral2000-big.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "width": 788,
      "height": 517
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Dive with Sharks"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Dive with Sharks",
      "html": "<strong>Dive with Sharks</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Do you dare?",
      "html": "Do you dare?"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Dive in the shark pool for a heart-racing and emotional encounter with the sea's iconic and ancient creatures! Accompanied by a professional diver, come face-to-fin with sharks, sting rays and manta rays. Swim with the predators , no cage!",
      "html": "Dive in the shark pool for a heart-racing and emotional encounter with the sea's iconic and ancient creatures! Accompanied by a professional diver, come face-to-fin with sharks, sting rays and manta rays. Swim with the predators , no cage!"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "* Advanced booking required ** (Due to COVID19 this activity is currently suspended).",
      "html": "* Advanced booking required ** (<span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: #ffffff; color: #333333; cursor: text; font-family: Arial,'Times New Roman','Bitstream Charter',Times,serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: right; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">Due to COVID19</span> this activity is currently suspended)."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "For valid PADI diving license holders only ***",
      "html": "For valid PADI diving license holders only ***"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "With valid diving insurance ****",
      "html": "With valid diving insurance ****"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "From age 12 and up.",
      "html": "From age 12 and up."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Book a scuba dive with sharks and receive a FREE Park Admission Ticket!",
      "html": "<strong>Book a scuba dive with sharks and receive a FREE Park Admission Ticket!</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "(Price including entrance to the Park: 600 NIS)",
      "html": "(Price including entrance to the Park: 600 NIS)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Extra Underwater Video Souvenir: 250 NIS",
      "html": "Extra Underwater Video Souvenir: 250 NIS"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "src": "https://coralworld.co.il/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/sharkdive-big.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "width": 788,
      "height": 517
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Sting-ray cave"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Sink into a Sting-ray cave.",
      "html": "<strong>Sink into a Sting-ray cave.</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The sting-ray cave is the ultimate 'selfie' opportunity.",
      "html": "The sting-ray cave is the ultimate 'selfie' opportunity."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Get under the water with one of our professional divers and test out scuba diving in a completely safe environment! This is a great chance to wave to your family and friends through the large glass windows of our sting-ray cave.",
      "html": "Get under the water with one of our professional divers and test out scuba diving in a completely safe environment!&nbsp; This is a great chance to wave to your family and friends through the large glass windows of our sting-ray cave."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Drop in and get to know the numerous sting rays and colorful fish, just like a professional diver.",
      "html": "Drop in and get to know the numerous sting rays and colorful fish, just like a professional diver."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Diving is from age 8.",
      "html": "Diving is from age 8."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Advanced booking required. (Due to COVID19 this activity is currently suspended).",
      "html": "Advanced booking required. <span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: #ffffff; color: #333333; cursor: text; font-family: Arial,'Times New Roman','Bitstream Charter',Times,serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: right; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">(</span>Due to COVID19<span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: #ffffff; color: #333333; cursor: text; font-family: Arial,'Times New Roman','Bitstream Charter',Times,serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: right; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"> this activity is currently suspended).</span>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Price -99 NIS per person.",
      "html": "Price -99 NIS per person."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "src": "https://coralworld.co.il/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/firstdive-big.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "width": 788,
      "height": 517
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Snorkelling"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Snorkle like you mean it!",
      "html": "<strong>Snorkle like you mean it!</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "First time snorkelling? - Learn how from the experts, at the Underwater Observatory.",
      "html": "First time snorkelling? -&nbsp; Learn how from the experts, at the Underwater Observatory."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Meet sea- life up close and personal and swim with the fish, between the corals. Snorkelling is a real hands-on experience in the Red Sea, so spend some time under the water in our safe waters!",
      "html": "Meet sea- life up close and personal and swim with the fish, between the corals. Snorkelling is a real hands-on experience in the Red Sea, so spend some time under the water in our safe waters!"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "* Advanced booking is required. (Due to COVID19 this activity is currently suspended).",
      "html": "* Advanced booking is required. <span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: #ffffff; color: #333333; cursor: text; font-family: Arial,'Times New Roman','Bitstream Charter',Times,serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: right; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">(</span>Due to COVID19<span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: #ffffff; color: #333333; cursor: text; font-family: Arial,'Times New Roman','Bitstream Charter',Times,serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: right; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"> this activity is currently suspended).</span>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Cost + + From age 8",
      "html": "Cost + + From age 8"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "src": "https://coralworld.co.il/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/snorkel-big.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "width": 788,
      "height": 517
    }
